        "fontSize": 13,
        "fontColor": "#744210"
      },
      "data": {
        "label": "Meridian Rail — full IT landscape (as-is)\n\nAn enterprise architect's survey of the whole estate, before the modernization program. ~70 services across 10 business domains (grouped spatially, by label, not by container), each tagged for GDPR data sensitivity, NIS2 regulatory scope, owning team, business domain, and lifecycle state — plus real integration edges between them. Toggle highlights (bottom-left) to overlay any tag dimension, e.g. owning team, over the integration structure below — this is the base landscape that #2 (GDPR overlay) and #3 (NIS2 overlay) are built on."
      }
    },
